  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GOGSFE &#x2013; support CoC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) has supported a number of policymakers active in the field of energy access to participate in the Community of Champions (CoC), as part of the Global Off-Grid Forum and Expo (GOGSFE), organised by GOGLA (8-10 October 2024). The aim of the support was to facilitate exchange between the policymakers, enable cross-country learning and generate exchanges with companies.</narrative>
  </description>
